


>> CoffeeMachine := ວັດຖຸ ໃໝ່.
CoffeeMachine ເມື່ອ: ['order:'] ເຮັດ: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) ຖ້າຈິງ: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) ຖ້າຈິງ: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) ຖ້າຈິງ: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := ວັດຖຸ ໃໝ່.
SimpleCoffeeMachine ເມື່ອ: ['order'] ເຮັດ: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: redCup, ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: greenCup, ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: yellowCup, ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: blueCup, ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: blackCup, ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.
blackCup ຕໍ່ທ້າຍ: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ຜົນອອກ ຂຽນ: orangeCup, ຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່.
